            "heading_logo": "<h2 class=\"section-title__inner\">\n    A Little Bit Of <span class=\"animatelogo\"> <img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0509/9677/3062/files/main-logo-yellow.svg?v=1767872629\"></span> Science\n</h2>",
